# SPDX schema attribution and scope

`sbom-spdx-2.3-schema.json` is an unmodified copy of the complete SPDX 2.3 JSON
schema by the SPDX project, from the SPDX Specification v2.3 repository:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/spdx/spdx-spec/v2.3/schemas/spdx-schema.json

The upstream repository license is Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/spdx/spdx-spec/v2.3/LICENSE
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

The retained schema has 45312 bytes and SHA-256
`239208b7ac287b3cf5d9a9af23f9d69863971102a5e1587a27a398b43490b89b`.
It is copied from the identical B2-retained MO-1305 correction schema. Its bytes
were preserved, not rewritten or narrowed. Complete jsonschema Draft7Validator
validation runs with all remote resolution prohibited. The schema and validators
are engineering artifacts and are absent from the immutable product archive.

This attribution does not assert SPDX project endorsement of MemoryOS.
The SPDX document dataLicense CC0-1.0 applies to generated SPDX document data;
it does not replace this schema's upstream repository license or grant rights
in the software components described by that document.
